.*/
# Keep shared GitHub configuration eligible for version control.
!.github/
!.github/**
**/build/
**/install/
**/log/
**/run/
**/.migration-backup/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
